	<section_number>51.1-124.6</section_number>
	<catch_line>Benefits to be paid monthly</catch_line>
	<text>
		All benefits payable by the Retirement System shall be paid in equal monthly installments, unless the Board approves another method of payment.
	</text>
	<history>1952, c. 353, § 51-111.71; 1990, c. 832, § 51.1-104; 1994, cc. 4, 85.</history>
